 "title": "Constructible torsion sheaves on a curve",
 "statement": "Let $(C,F)$ be a curve coefficient pair [def-weil-pbc-curve-setting]. The\ntorsion sheaf $F$ is *constructible* if $C$ has a finite partition by locally\nclosed constructible subschemes on each of which its restriction is locally\nconstant with finite stalks.",
